    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0074",
    "t": [
      442.58,
      448.38
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "我们还切连吃老鸡蛋方便面 老这跟我们有什么关系"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0075",
    "t": [
      448.58,
      451.18
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "妈妈还没讲完呢 切着讲"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0076",
    "t": [
      452.38,
      464.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "我尽心尽力地照顾这老太太 可是这个老太太由于年老体弱 并情突然恶化 血压增高 体温下降 只有出的轻儿 没有尽的轻儿"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0077",
    "t": [
      467.18,
      468.58
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "可这跟我们有什么关系"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0078",
    "t": [
      468.58,
      469.58
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "对啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0079",
    "t": [
      469.78,
      480.58
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "医院啊 派了最好的大夫全力强救 可是这个老太太 还是昏迷不醒 生死未铺 医院 就吓了病危通知待"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0080",
    "t": [
      481.18,
      482.58
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "可这跟我们有什么"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0081",
    "t": [
      482.58,
      511.58
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "我知道 这跟你们 现在还没有关系 可是往后就有关系了 问题啊 就出在这个病人的家属身上 这病人 他们家有二十多个家属 而且一个个 都是人高马大的 轻壮年男士 他们一听 老太太马上就要生命 纯维 嫁荷西去了 全体的 激火攻击 通脑发热 丧致你"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0082",
    "t": [
      512.58,
      515.18
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "嫁荷西去是什么意思"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0083",
    "t": [
      515.58,
      516.58
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "什么疼人吗"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0084",
    "t": [
      516.98,
      520.18
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "你刚才说老太太生命 纯维的时候 用过这个词"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0085",
    "t": [
      520.78,
      524.98
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "安姿面的解释 就是一个人 骑着先喝 往西边飞去了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0086",
    "t": [
      525.38,
      528.38
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "都变成那样了 还怎么飞啊 哎呀"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0087",
    "t": [
      528.38,
      530.78
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "是先喝飞 又不老太太飞"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0088",
    "t": [
      531.38,
      534.78
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "你又说 先喝喝老太太一块飞吗"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0089",
    "t": [
      536.78,
      538.58
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "咱不说飞的事儿了 行不行"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0090",
    "t": [
      538.78,
      541.18
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "我还是明白什么叫嫁荷西去"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0091",
    "t": [
      542.58,
      547.58
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "这个意思啊 简单的 还行 就是死了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0092",
    "t": [
      548.18,
      549.18
    ],
    "speaker": "ENSEMBLE",
    "text": "我明白了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0093",
    "t": [
      549.98,
      550.58
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "接着说"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0094",
    "t": [
      551.58,
      553.38
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "我刚才说哪儿了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0095",
    "t": [
      553.58,
      557.18
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "好 你说到他们 激火攻击 通脑发热 丧致理智"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0096",
    "t": [
      557.58,
      571.18
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "对 他们呀 非说是手术后 没有护理好 才导致病人恶化的 于是大吵大闹不算 还要报复 直接责任人 也就是我 你们的妈妈"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0097",
    "t": [
      573.58,
      587.58
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "很高兴 没有听到你们再说 跟你们没关系 医院的领导 为了防止发生意外 特意让你妈妈 再加休息几天 就是为了 防止那些病人的家属 恶意报复 对"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0098",
    "t": [
      590.98,
      592.18
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "他们三十多都下啥"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0099",
    "t": [
      594.98,
      599.78
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "这也难怪 和平年代温世的花朵 哪经历过这些"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0100",
    "t": [
      600.38,
      601.78
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "我在思考"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0101",
    "t": [
      602.38,
      605.18
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "我也在思考 思考"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0102",
    "t": [
      605.58,
      609.98
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "你们思考什么呀 一换秋分 那是社会学家思考的问题"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0103",
    "t": [
      611.78,
      614.58
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "说了半天这事儿啊 就是为了告诉你"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0104",
    "t": [
      614.58,
      615.98
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "哎 我有一个问题"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0105",
    "t": [
      616.98,
      617.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "我也有"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0106",
    "t": [
      619.38,
      621.38
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "我 我没跟他们说明白吗"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0107",
    "t": [
      621.38,
      623.98
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "就是 尝尝 哎 个人呗"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0108",
    "t": [
      624.98,
      631.38
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "我的问题是 您说的是真的吗 不会做什么了吗 你们还算不出来"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0109",
    "t": [
      632.18,
      636.58
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "那些高党为猛来着 不善的病人家属 已经在咱们家附近出梦了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0110",
    "t": [
      637.98,
      638.98
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "这要报复啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0111",
    "t": [
      638.98,
      640.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "那 那为什么不找警察呀"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0112",
    "t": [
      641.58,
      643.58
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "他们要报复还没报复呢"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0113",
    "t": [
      643.58,
      644.98
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "警察不还管呢"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0114",
    "t": [
      645.18,
      647.18
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "只好等报复还来说"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0115",
    "t": [
      647.78,
      650.78
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "等报复完了 你妈呀差不多完了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0116",
    "t": [
      651.58,
      659.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "这事儿稳定 你说这没出事 那警察也管不着 这万一要出了事儿 警察在管 也晚了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0117",
    "t": [
      660.78,
      662.38
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "这还真是个问题"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0118",
    "t": [
      662.58,
      664.38
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "社会学家怎么说的"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0119",
    "t": [
      664.38,
      668.78
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "先本管社会学家说什么 现在的问题是 哎"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0120",
    "t": [
      669.38,
      673.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "我也看出来了 咱家这三孩子 一点危机意识都没有"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0121",
    "t": [
      674.18,
      683.98
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "没错 我看 不能劳给他们讲什么谣语花香 不给他们上点危机意识的课 他们永远不明白 什么叫生命中 不能承受之重"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0122",
    "t": [
      684.18,
      703.58
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "没错 走 他们不是喜欢上网吗 咱把电脑打开 咱们就把那个 三达不留点耐的 点碎音咱全打开 直接进入突发行善件的相关网页 咱们把这个警惕性和危机意识 全给他补上 恶补"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0123",
    "t": [
      705.98,
      716.98
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "某年某月某地 某患者身患绝症一致无效 随千某云医生 怀转见到 冲入办公室 将组织医生刺死"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0124",
    "t": [
      719.98,
      728.98
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "某年某月某地 某患者对治疗效果不买 于是纠结亲属 对一户人员大大充手 是伤症落下终身残忌"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0125",
    "t": [
      731.98,
      738.98
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "某年某月某地 某人为什么 实施报复 闯入世主家中 将世主的三个孩子绑架"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0126",
    "t": [
      741.98,
      753.98
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "现在明白了吧 大人的担心是有根据的 有些不该发生的事情 的确发生过 而且很有可能再次发生 危险 就在你们身边"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0127",
    "t": [
      761.98,
      769.98
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "孩子们 我相信 在预防突发世界方面 我们已经达成了共识 解决 就是要付出行动"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0128",
    "t": [
      773.98,
      788.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "一定要提高警惕 一定要留神陌生人 万一要是在外头 有不认识的人问你们说 小孩 你妈在哪儿工作呀 你们就回答说 我妈妈是原定局重数的"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0129",
    "t": [
      790.98,
      804.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "尤其是 在咱们家门口 附近出现的陌生人 要严加方法 不要和陌生说话 不要让陌生进家门 万一要有高大微蒙者 气势凶凶长上门来 你们赶紧跑 闭关武"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0130",
    "t": [
      807.98,
      815.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "妈妈不要你们建议永违 你们跑得越来越好 你们只要安全 妈妈死也就明白"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0131",
    "t": [
      815.98,
      816.98
    ],
    "speaker": "ENSEMBLE",
    "text": "妈"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0132",
    "t": [
      822.98,
      830.98
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "我宣布 咱们家从现在开始 进入紧急状态 真是我们的专用警报"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0133",
    "t": [
      832.98,
      835.98
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "少想人散 一切行动听指挥"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0134",
    "t": [
      853.98,
      858.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "与兴 与兴 这跟你没有安全感"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0135",
    "t": [
      859.98,
      863.98
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "你好好学习 等以后学生才 自然就有势力顾保标了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0136",
    "t": [
      864.98,
      867.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "怎么又跟学习点上啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0137",
    "t": [
      867.98,
      869.98
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "这是大人的思维"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0138",
    "t": [
      870.98,
      875.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "自从咱家进入紧急状态以后 我就觉得我自己长大"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0139",
    "t": [
      876.98,
      877.98
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "怎么了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0140",
    "t": [
      878.98,
      879.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "好听人跟蹤咱们"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0141",
    "t": [
      883.98,
      886.98
    ],
    "speaker": "胡一统",
    "text": "怎么意思"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0142",
    "t": [
      888.98,
      897.98
    ],
    "speaker": "胡一统",
    "text": "这小子怎么碰着我就跑了 有了心点忘了就跌了 行下的 我饶不了你"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0143",
    "t": [
      907.98,
      910.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "干吗 干吗 干吗去怎么了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0144",
    "t": [
      910.98,
      911.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "有人跟踪我们"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0145",
    "t": [
      912.98,
      914.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "既然一个了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0146",
    "t": [
      915.98,
      917.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "没看见的还不知道多了呢"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0147",
    "t": [
      918.98,
      919.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "找到玩来啦"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0148",
    "t": [
      925.98,
      926.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "咱们家门后转"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0149",
    "t": [
      926.98,
      927.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "咱家在敲不睡"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0150",
    "t": [
      930.98,
      932.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "你是不是已经砸了嘛"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0151",
    "t": [
      937.98,
      940.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "好像是我爸 什么"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0152",
    "t": [
      941.98,
      944.98
    ],
    "speaker": "胡一统",
    "text": "谁啊 赵水 我 回头"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0153",
    "t": [
      947.98,
      948.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "你来干吗来了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0154",
    "t": [
      950.98,
      966.98
    ],
    "speaker": "胡一统",
    "text": "我还想问你呢 你跟我们父子使什么力见记了 使什么了 大老长看见我就跑 装不认识我 教得喜心眼就是不是 我这舅爹他也是亲爹 当时他就是中生志是不是"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0155",
    "t": [
      967.98,
      971.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "行了 行了 我没性子跟你吵 是什么孩子没人出来你"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0156",
    "t": [
      972.98,
      973.98
    ],
    "speaker": "胡一统",
    "text": "我儿子认不出来我"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0157",
    "t": [
      974.98,
      977.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "我没说他 我说他 他没认出你来"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0158",
    "t": [
      977.98,
      978.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "我 我不是你儿子"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0159",
    "t": [
      980.98,
      981.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "行了 行了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0160",
    "t": [
      981.98,
      983.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "你来的不是时候 我们还有拿你当坏人了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0161",
    "t": [
      984.98,
      988.98
    ],
    "speaker": "胡一统",
    "text": "我向坏人嘛 你这可是缺乏我笑向全啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0162",
    "t": [
      989.98,
      993.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "爸 你真来的不是时候 我们家正在非常时期"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0163",
    "t": [
      994.98,
      996.98
    ],
    "speaker": "胡一统",
    "text": "你发给你爸 吓起来了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0164",
    "t": [
      998.98,
      999.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "你在这样我可吓朱河令了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0165",
    "t": [
      1000.98,
      1001.98
    ],
    "speaker": "胡一统",
    "text": "那到底为什么"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0166",
    "t": [
      1002.98,
      1003.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "你管呢 有你事没有啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0167",
    "t": [
      1005.98,
      1006.98
    ],
    "speaker": "胡一统",
    "text": "那还是吓起来了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0168",
    "t": [
      1007.98,
      1008.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "爸 我跟你说吧"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0169",
    "t": [
      1015.98,
      1016.98
    ],
    "speaker": "胡一统",
    "text": "闹了半天是这么当的事"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0170",
    "t": [
      1018.98,
      1020.98
    ],
    "speaker": "胡一统",
    "text": "你们家在坊备恐怖袭击"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0171",
    "t": [
      1022.98,
      1026.98
    ],
    "speaker": "胡一统",
    "text": "还要操办你了 sorry 对不住啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0172",
    "t": [
      1028.98,
      1033.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "你到底干嘛来了 有话你就赶紧说 没什么事你就赶紧走吧"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0173",
    "t": [
      1033.98,
      1045.98
    ],
    "speaker": "胡一统",
    "text": "这事让我赶上了 我怎么也得说几句安慰的话 是不是 那老太太要是死在走出台上 也就没你什么事了 那家属也就转不着你了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0174",
    "t": [
      1046.98,
      1048.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "是不是 说完没"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0175",
    "t": [
      1050.98,
      1059.98
    ],
    "speaker": "胡一统",
    "text": "你可真够贝的啊 那换上家属一道群 还以壮胆居多 要真打起来 你也不是哥"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0176",
    "t": [
      1062.98,
      1064.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "你这是安慰我的吧"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0177",
    "t": [
      1067.98,
      1070.98
    ],
    "speaker": "胡一统",
    "text": "顺便发表一点感慨"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0178",
    "t": [
      1072.98,
      1079.98
    ],
    "speaker": "胡一统",
    "text": "咋俩没散伙那这儿 你看没着遭遇 也没这么被 也没那么倒霉"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0179",
    "t": [
      1080.98,
      1081.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "出去"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0180",
    "t": [
      1089.98,
      1093.98
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "孩子们快吃就是吃 看妈妈做了多好吃的东西 快快"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0181",
    "t": [
      1093.98,
      1097.98
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雪",
    "text": "小雪 美味烤 连机吃我都不觉得香了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0182",
    "t": [
      1098.98,
      1102.98
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "我也要多吃一件 看看"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0183",
    "t": [
      1102.98,
      1106.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "还是小语现在好 因为这个能是 咱家最后的晚餐了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0184",
    "t": [
      1107.98,
      1109.98
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "你这从何说起啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0185",
    "t": [
      1110.98,
      1115.98
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "要是遭遇突发事件 那咱家吃饭的人就不全了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0186",
    "t": [
      1115.98,
      1123.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "把老大容级合理 花老啊 容级合理 把老三容级合理"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0187",
    "t": [
      1124.98,
      1128.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "小东孩 咱们这危机教育 是不是做得有点过啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0188",
    "t": [
      1132.98,
      1142.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "有点电话吗 把你们吓成这样 出来出来出来 你先 接去 快点 你打着小那样 吃饭"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0189",
    "t": [
      1144.98,
      1146.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "你接 你接"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0190",
    "t": [
      1148.98,
      1149.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "喂"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0191",
    "t": [
      1150.98,
      1153.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "怎么了 这个男的 还是个陌生人"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0192",
    "t": [
      1153.98,
      1155.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "听听了是个状态啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0193",
    "t": [
      1155.98,
      1157.98
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "听到你那儿 但是小那样"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0194",
    "t": [
      1158.98,
      1165.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘星",
    "text": "喂 是个男的 陌生人 听听了是个状态啊 对对对对 对对"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0195",
    "t": [
      1165.98,
      1173.98
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "我来 是个电话 你想 喂 我告诉你一个寻经病 你再往属下打电话 你看"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0196",
    "t": [
      1176.98,
      1184.98
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "刚才是那个 刘美姐的电话 我刚才在刚才 那是刘星 喂 喂"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0197",
    "t": [
      1187.98,
      1188.98
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "花了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0198",
    "t": [
      1188.98,
      1189.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "谁啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0199",
    "t": [
      1189.98,
      1190.98
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "我爸"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0200",
    "t": [
      1195.98,
      1200.98
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "哎 这让下去可不行啊 这帮孩子 全都神经过名藏不接兵了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0201",
    "t": [
      1200.98,
      1204.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "对啊 过度防范 已经完全影响了 咱们的正常生活了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0202",
    "t": [
      1206.98,
      1208.98
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "这危机 是让咱们给整大了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0203",
    "t": [
      1208.98,
      1210.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "赶紧往回送吧"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0204",
    "t": [
      1213.98,
      1219.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "嗯 对吧 哎呀 孩子们 注意了 爸爸要宣布一件事情"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0205",
    "t": [
      1221.98,
      1226.98
    ],
    "speaker": "夏东海",
    "text": "我宣布 咱们家的紧急状态 就此解决 解决 来了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0206",
    "t": [
      1229.98,
      1231.98
    ],
    "speaker": "胡一统",
    "text": "谁啊 我"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0207",
    "t": [
      1231.98,
      1239.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "你好 好衣 这回事 嘿 你怎么来了"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0208",
    "t": [
      1239.98,
      1245.98
    ],
    "speaker": "胡一统",
    "text": "你放心 我绝不多待 办一病人家所闹着门 把我一块 你说多远的 是不是啊"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0209",
    "t": [
      1245.98,
      1248.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "我们刚接触警报 你怎么又知道 警长空气眼"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0210",
    "t": [
      1248.98,
      1252.98
    ],
    "speaker": "胡一统",
    "text": "我没别的意思 我就是不放心我儿子 想待得跟我先走两天"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0211",
    "t": [
      1253.98,
      1255.98
    ],
    "speaker": "刘梅",
    "text": "这 这合适吗"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0212",
    "t": [
      1255.98,
      1258.98
    ],
    "speaker": "胡一统",
    "text": "这要什么不合适的呀 对对"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0213",
    "t": [
      1258.98,
      1259.98
    ],
    "speaker": "夏雨",
    "text": "把我也带去"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0214",
    "t": [
      1259.98,
      1262.98
    ],
    "speaker": "胡一统",
    "text": "你们 你就先歸你爸爸"
  },
  {
    "series": "jiayouernv",
    "ep": "012",
    "unit_id": "u0215",
    "t": [
      1262.98,
      1267.98
